      "description": "A human hand is gripping the hand of an orangutan, symbolizing a connection or intervention. The human hand is light-skinned and centrally positioned, while the orangutan's hand is covered in fur and appears to be held firmly. This visual metaphor is used in the context of a meme calling for the end of racism, though the imagery invokes problematic racial stereotypes.",
