      "instance_name": "anti_black_stereotype_primate_comparison",
      "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Comparing Black People to Primates",
      "description": "This stereotype dehumanizes Black people by equating them with non-human primates, historically used to justify slavery, segregation, and systemic racism. The meme's visual metaphor of a human hand holding an orangutan's hand invokes this harmful trope, even if the intent is to promote anti-racism.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
