      "description": "A system of oppression based on race, historically and currently used to justify discrimination, violence, and inequality against marginalized groups, particularly Black people. The meme attempts to address this issue but risks reinforcing harmful stereotypes through its imagery.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
