      "description": "The image expresses a harmful emotional undertone by invoking a long-standing racist stereotype that dehumanizes Black people by comparing them to primates. This visual metaphor, even if intended to promote anti-racism, carries an emotionally charged and offensive connotation rooted in historical racism.",
