      "description": "The visual metaphor of a human hand holding an orangutan's hand, used to represent 'let's end racism', invokes a long-standing racist trope that dehumanizes Black people by equating them with non-human primates. This imagery, even if intended to promote anti-racism, carries the potential to cause harm by reinforcing harmful stereotypes and potentially alienating or offending its intended audience.",
